      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso",
          "value": "<p>Bava Batra; [Samuel ben \u1e24ofni Ga\u2019on\u2019s] Book [of Abutter\u2019s Rights] to Preempt [Sale]; glossary of the Mishnah; questions; additional questions; midrash on \u1e24ayye Sarah [Genesis 23:1]; penitential prayers for the Day of Atonement; Samuel; Scripture; commentary on Job; homiletical sermons; questions; a bundle containing notes and reminders; [various] booklets; penitential prayers for the Day of Atonement; a bundle containing booklets; a booklet containing an index of responsa; Evel Rabbati [the minor tractate on mourning]; Book of Tradition; explication of words; a book on medicine; homiletic interpretation of the [book of] Ruth; questions; a bundle with penitential prayer; Hayya Ga\u2019on\u2019s Norms of Conduct for the Judge.</p>\n<p>Isaac ben Samuel, may he rest in peace</p>\n<p>Abraham bar Shemaiah he-\u1e25aver [the fellow], great-grandson of Shemaiah Ga\u2019on</p>\n<p>Abraham ben Aaron he-\u1e25aver</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
